i4="}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ea3e597-1cd7-4be8-8d1e-00bd68dbed13","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ゼンリンとの提携が終わってから信用度はだいぶ落ちてますね…。","ts":"1627045618.183600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uu6b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa9c888c-6d53-44ef-bbd0-2e5db7bf739e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、あくまで汎用ナビレベルとは思って使うけど(詳細に弱い意味で)","ts":"1627045580.182800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YPz+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32e4dabb-a5e5-44c0-a41c-de89bc58d838","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"則ってないかな？w","ts":"1627045577.182500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kkva"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a863ed4c-be3f-4e87-a060-6623b461762e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"グーグルマップの地図案内ってどこの国の法律に則ってるんですかね","ts":"1627045565.182000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R+ml"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3853c4f-1ceb-4732-925d-d5cbd50db34d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ナビ使ったら一方通行の道を逆走しろと出てきてそれ以来あんまり信用してない…。","ts":"1627045513.181200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fWme"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91b27efe-95e1-4353-8c7d-dfa3bf294a7f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"GoogleのMapの各情報は地図としては信用しても、情報配置物としてあまり利用してない、みたいなのありますしね...","ts":"1627045431.180500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BFs2n"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"意外と見てる人少ないんですよねここ…。","ts":"1627044904.179600","files":[{"id":"F028KBMAS4F","created":1627044901,"timestamp":1627044901,"name":"クリップボード01.png","title":"クリップボード01.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U0