:4,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U01AQ5BFNLX","UL6CFN8NR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KeEQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0a45c05-f9a9-464d-be6c-1e340d3214de","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; Mondai sore ja nai.\n好き","ts":"1627030547.171200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+E2I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B62F7A48-4997-42B7-A45E-8E48F79BCCD6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"読みづらい…","ts":"1627030472.170900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wY0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1dee3e23-3187-49ef-a7f7-39fc8e42fc32","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"かなり理解可能なのがおもしろいです","ts":"1627030076.170400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gGPwd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4642313e-28cd-4545-b510-976fd8836e80","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"カタカナ日本語面白い","ts":"1627030042.169500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9yjLQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75abf2de-a229-4aec-b2e5-da20d73285e0","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"issue に最高なコメントが来ました。\n\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-compe/issues/492#issuecomment-885489384|https://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-compe/issues/492#issuecomment-885489384\u003e","ts":"1627030018.169000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-compe/issues/492#issuecomment-885489384|Comment on #492 Compe buffer source interferes with Ultisnips tabstops  \u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-compe/issues/492#issuecomment-885489384|Comment on #492 Compe buffer source interferes with Ultisnips tabstops  \u003e","text":"It’s okay! No problem! I know some Japanese so let me try that.\n\nTashkani ultisnips snippets o complete koto ga dekimasu. Mondai sore ja nai. Buffer source o tsukatte toki ultisnips no tab ga chotte dake kowarimasu. Sore dake desu.\n\nTatoeba snippet ga buffer no words to onaji nattara, snippet no execution jikan ni nvim-compe no pop up ga ikimasu. Sono ato tab wa kikanai.\n\nSono tame ni buffer ‘default_pattern’ o ‘[[\\w+]]’ set kuretanda, soshite ‘tab’ wa ima ok desu. \u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-compe/issues/167|#167\u003e to onaji desu.\n\nchotto shitsumon wa kore deshita: kono pattern wa best desu ka? Anata no default pattern wa osoraku ‘{,},^..}’ o recognise kuretanda. Kore wa ‘[A-Za-z0-9]’ dake o recognise ga dekimasu. Sore ni, buffer no kotoba to betsu nani mono o complete koto no hitsuyo wa arimasu ka?\n\nNihongo de ayamachi o yurushtekudasai demo kono ato mo romaji de hanasu koto no hitsuyo nara oshiete kudasai.\n\nArigatou! Hopefully I have conveyed it to you!","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/hrsh7th/nvim-compe|hrsh7th/nvim-compe\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1627029506}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":8,"users":["U7JL1UKKL","UDDCM376D","U7HFY4HFY","U013QL1RAPN","U01AQ5BFNLX","U0230SSJ32B","U01H161HVPS","U81LLJ340"]},{"name":"goodpoem","count":3,"users":["U01H161HVPS","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9chw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14eb7264-2af3-406e-a576-32216a8cb093","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"名前が変わってアーティスティックスイミングに","ts":"1627026830.167800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uczR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18d8ff20-2e6d-48fe-8be3-2d6609771e4b","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"ダンシングおにぎりを思い出すやつだった","ts":"1627006680.166900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PZ7"}]},{